25:    `generated-input-provenance.md`. These are the authoritative selected inputs for steps 3–5.
26:    On any nonzero exit, preserve those outputs and relay `exit: 2`, `fits: unavailable`,
27:    `clusterFits: []`, `clusters: 0`, `dir: [OUT_DIR]`, with `cause` prefixed
28:    `review input selection:` and the command's explicit evidence gap. Stop here; an invalid
29:    provenance refusal remains unavailable through any fallback, never a clean assembly.
30:    For other consumers, run `git diff --stat [BASE]..[HEAD] > [OUT_DIR]/diffstat.txt`.
